@title 2026 Engagement Survey: Results
@subtitle Northwind Freight, for all staff

# Response
kpi Response rate | 79.4% | 842 of 1,060 employees

Thank you to everyone who took part. 842 of our 1,060 employees responded, a response rate of 79.4 percent.

# Results by statement
data results = Statement,Favorable (%),Neutral (%),Unfavorable (%); I understand how my work supports company goals,78,15,7; My manager gives me useful feedback,64,22,14; I have the tools I need to do my job,71,18,11; I see a path to grow here,49,27,24; I would recommend this company as a place to work,69,20,11
table results

Favorable, neutral and unfavorable are the shares of responses for each statement.

# Change since 2025
kpi Average favorable | 66.2% | +1.2 pts | good
data change = Statement,Last year,This year; I understand how my work supports company goals,76,78; My manager gives me useful feedback,61,64; I have the tools I need to do my job,70,71; I see a path to grow here,52,49; I would recommend this company as a place to work,66,69
chart hbar change y=Last year,This year labels title="Favorable score, last year and this year"

The average favorable score rose from 65.0 last year to 66.2 this year. Manager feedback and recommending the company each rose 3 points. Growth fell 3 points, to 49 percent, and it is also our lowest score.

# What we will do
1. Publish the career framework by 2027-02-28.
2. Train 90 managers on giving feedback, starting 2026-12-01.
3. Run a short pulse check in April 2027.
